From a8cfd7c25b0f2cf1561ee46d3001b281b06fa75b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 22:12:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 049/211] clk: sunxi-ng: add the Allwinner A733 SerDes
 subsystem CCU

Describe the USB3 part of the A733 SerDes subsystem top registers: the
AHB and AXI clock gates of the controller, the PIPE clock source mux and
the reset of the controller's USB2 PHY. Without the gates the controller
registers are not reachable, and without the PIPE mux pointing at the
USB2 side a controller without an attached combo PHY never leaves soft
reset.

The registers are only reachable with the subsystem bus clocks running
and its reset released, so the driver takes those from its own node.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
